+
+The pre-commit hook regenerates and stages every generated block on each commit. Edit a generated block only through its generator script. Without the hook, run `scripts/precommit_regenerate.py`, or run the generator for one file.
+
 ## Writing Conventions
 
 Docs under `docs/diataxis/` are written deliberately in their Diátaxis mode, not lifted from elsewhere. The compass test ("What problem does this solve for the reader?") governs what stays, what splits, what cross-references, and what drops.
